@startuml
title US-004 - Register resource - SD level 2
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Admin or Staff" as Staff
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over UI, API
  The organization comes from the caller's session.
end note
Staff -> UI: Register resource (name, type, optional description)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /resources (RegisterResourceDto)
activate API
alt Caller cannot manage resources
    API --> UI: 403 Forbidden
else Invalid details or type not available to the organization
    API --> UI: 400 Bad Request
else Plan resource limit reached
    API --> UI: 409 Conflict
else Persistence failure
    API --> UI: 500 Internal Server Error
else Request accepted
    API --> UI: 201 Created (ResourceDto)
end
deactivate API
alt Successful response
    UI --> Staff: Resource created with status Available
else Error response
    UI --> Staff: Show authorization, validation, limit, or operation error
end
deactivate UI
@enduml
